WEBVTT

00:00:03.636 --> 00:00:05.297
Last time
on Star Trek: Voyager...

00:00:05.372 --> 00:00:07.738
Two more of the mutations
have been discovered

00:00:07.807 --> 00:00:09.274
in Spatial Grid 649.

00:00:09.342 --> 00:00:12.277
Have their cortical nodes
removed and analyzed.

00:00:12.345 --> 00:00:14.074
I'm regenerating.
This is only a dream.

00:00:14.147 --> 00:00:15.171
You're not dreaming.

00:00:15.248 --> 00:00:16.237
I brought you here.

00:00:16.316 --> 00:00:17.544
This is Unimatrix Zero.

00:00:17.617 --> 00:00:19.107
You used to come here,

00:00:19.185 --> 00:00:21.585
before you escaped
the collective.

00:00:21.654 --> 00:00:23.246
Unimatrix Zero is real,

00:00:23.323 --> 00:00:25.951
and so are the people
who go there.

00:00:26.026 --> 00:00:27.425
They need our help.

00:00:27.494 --> 00:00:30.486
If we can't terminate
their link...

00:00:30.563 --> 00:00:34.624
then we'll simply have
to pay them a visit.

00:00:38.038 --> 00:00:39.437
The people there are vulnerable.

00:00:39.506 --> 00:00:41.167
They don't have the ability
to take action

00:00:41.241 --> 00:00:42.970
in the real world.

00:00:43.109 --> 00:00:45.202
We're going to give them
that ability.

00:00:45.278 --> 00:00:46.506
Tend to your own crew.

00:00:46.579 --> 00:00:48.979
Stay away from things
that don't concern you.

00:00:49.082 --> 00:00:50.515
I'm afraid I can't do that.

00:00:50.583 --> 00:00:55.452
We were more than friends,
weren't we?

00:00:55.522 --> 00:00:57.285
This is our target.

00:00:57.357 --> 00:00:58.949
You'll keep
a transporter lock on me.

00:00:59.025 --> 00:01:00.583
Once I make it
to the central plexus

00:01:00.660 --> 00:01:02.594
and release the virus,
you can beam me back.

00:01:02.662 --> 00:01:03.788
In how many pieces?

00:01:06.733 --> 00:01:08.325
Captain...

00:01:08.401 --> 00:01:11.302
I expected something
more cunning from you.

00:01:20.513 --> 00:01:22.310
Their life signs
are destabilizing.

00:01:30.223 --> 00:01:33.522
And now the conclusion.

00:02:06.159 --> 00:02:07.786
Lieutenant.

00:02:07.861 --> 00:02:09.453
I'm all right.

00:02:09.529 --> 00:02:11.793
You've been given
a subvocal processor.

00:02:11.865 --> 00:02:13.127
I can live with it.

00:02:13.199 --> 00:02:14.826
The Captain?

00:02:14.901 --> 00:02:16.027
We were separated.

00:02:16.102 --> 00:02:18.195
I don't know
where they took her.

00:02:18.271 --> 00:02:20.739
We must proceed
to the central plexus.

00:04:17.657 --> 00:04:18.749
Time?

00:04:18.825 --> 00:04:20.349
17 minutes.

00:04:20.426 --> 00:04:22.917
We should have heard
something by now.

00:04:23.062 --> 00:04:24.552
Doctor?

00:04:24.631 --> 00:04:27.566
Their higher brain
functions are stable.

00:04:28.701 --> 00:04:29.929
Cube's changing course.

00:04:30.036 --> 00:04:31.367
New heading: 121 mark 6.

00:04:31.437 --> 00:04:33.871
Matching course and speed.

00:04:37.877 --> 00:04:40.710
The damage to their propulsion
system is regenerating.

00:04:40.780 --> 00:04:43.943
They'll be capable of transwarp
in less than two hours.

00:04:44.083 --> 00:04:45.778
I want you inside
Unimatrix Zero.

00:04:45.852 --> 00:04:47.149
When the virus is released,

00:04:47.220 --> 00:04:49.654
your friends there
will be the first to know.

00:04:50.857 --> 00:04:53.382
Problem?

00:04:53.459 --> 00:04:54.756
No...

00:04:54.827 --> 00:04:57.295
but I wouldn't call
them my "friends."

00:04:57.363 --> 00:04:59.831
Acquaintances then.

00:04:59.899 --> 00:05:01.867
If you're having issues
with these people,

00:05:01.934 --> 00:05:03.663
I suggest you set them aside.

00:05:05.305 --> 00:05:06.772
Understood.

00:05:32.965 --> 00:05:37.095
Tell your hunters to patrol
the northeastern perimeter.

00:05:37.170 --> 00:05:39.502
More drones were spotted there.

00:05:39.572 --> 00:05:41.437
Understood.

00:05:41.507 --> 00:05:43.372
Where's that virus
you promised?

00:05:43.443 --> 00:05:45.502
Captain Janeway's
deploying it now.

00:05:45.578 --> 00:05:46.704
Good.

00:05:46.779 --> 00:05:48.940
The Borg have increased
their attacks here.

00:05:49.048 --> 00:05:50.811
They're identifying us
one by one.

00:05:50.883 --> 00:05:52.942
If you're looking for your mate,

00:05:53.052 --> 00:05:54.144
he is not here.

00:05:54.220 --> 00:05:55.517
He's not my mate.

00:05:55.588 --> 00:05:57.715
He must not be regenerating.

00:05:57.790 --> 00:05:59.189
That or he's dead.

00:05:59.258 --> 00:06:01.954
He should have
been here hours ago.

00:06:02.028 --> 00:06:03.461
No one's seen him.

00:06:03.529 --> 00:06:05.759
If he died in battle,

00:06:05.832 --> 00:06:08.699
I'm sure it was honorable.

00:06:08.768 --> 00:06:10.929
Here, help me.

00:06:19.112 --> 00:06:22.479
It's obvious your heart
is in conflict.

00:06:22.548 --> 00:06:24.914
My heart is functioning
perfectly.

00:06:29.856 --> 00:06:32.916
Some advice from a warrior
in the bedchamber

00:06:33.025 --> 00:06:35.186
as well as the battlefield.

00:06:35.261 --> 00:06:36.421
At times like these,

00:06:36.496 --> 00:06:38.464
you must treat your heart
as the enemy,

00:06:38.531 --> 00:06:40.590
so you won't be distracted
in battle.

00:06:41.901 --> 00:06:43.528
I'll keep that in mind.

00:06:45.838 --> 00:06:48.033
Has the virus been deployed?

00:06:48.107 --> 00:06:49.472
I'm not sure.

00:06:49.542 --> 00:06:50.839
Do you remember anything?

00:06:50.910 --> 00:06:52.775
Your location?
What ship you're on?

00:06:52.845 --> 00:06:54.506
No, nothing.

00:07:11.864 --> 00:07:15.300
The central plexus
is through here.

00:07:18.271 --> 00:07:20.239
Those must be
the shield emitters

00:07:20.306 --> 00:07:21.830
that Seven told us about.

00:07:35.421 --> 00:07:37.446
We need to get
through that hatch.

00:07:37.523 --> 00:07:39.616
I'll attempt
to deactivate him.

00:07:47.500 --> 00:07:48.762
Captain.

00:07:48.835 --> 00:07:50.530
What's left of her.

00:07:50.603 --> 00:07:52.161
How are you holding up?

00:07:52.238 --> 00:07:53.830
- Fine.
- I can't access the plexus

00:07:53.906 --> 00:07:55.840
without shutting down
the power grid for this section.

00:07:55.908 --> 00:07:57.034
That's bound to draw attention.

00:07:57.109 --> 00:07:58.041
Is there another way in?

00:07:58.110 --> 00:07:59.270
The primary access port.

00:07:59.345 --> 00:08:00.607
I think it's isolated

00:08:00.680 --> 00:08:01.942
from the main power grid.

00:08:02.014 --> 00:08:03.106
Where is it?

00:08:03.182 --> 00:08:04.342
About 30 meters from here.

00:08:06.419 --> 00:08:09.013
Tuvok.

00:08:09.088 --> 00:08:10.919
Commander.

00:08:12.024 --> 00:08:14.754
I can hear the collective.

00:08:14.827 --> 00:08:17.990
The neural suppressant
must be wearing off.

00:08:18.064 --> 00:08:19.998
I'll be all right.

00:08:28.808 --> 00:08:30.776
I heard him...

00:08:30.843 --> 00:08:32.902
the Vulcan...

00:08:33.012 --> 00:08:35.810
but he's gone.

00:08:35.882 --> 00:08:38.612
Why?

00:08:38.684 --> 00:08:40.015
Why can't I hear the others?

00:09:41.747 --> 00:09:44.716
Leave this one to me.

00:09:50.790 --> 00:09:52.223
Comfortable?

00:09:52.291 --> 00:09:53.417
Release me.

00:09:53.492 --> 00:09:55.722
Easier said than done.

00:09:55.795 --> 00:09:59.060
I think I designed this trap
a little too well.

00:10:01.801 --> 00:10:03.632
What are you doing out here?

00:10:03.703 --> 00:10:05.603
Looking for you.

00:10:09.642 --> 00:10:11.940
Korok was concerned.

00:10:12.044 --> 00:10:14.444
That doesn't sound like Korok.

00:10:14.513 --> 00:10:17.209
He said you were missing.

00:10:17.283 --> 00:10:20.047
As you can see,
I've been busy setting traps.

00:10:20.119 --> 00:10:23.714
Not the most
sophisticated technology.

00:10:23.789 --> 00:10:25.120
Seems to work.

00:10:25.191 --> 00:10:27.318
Hold on.

00:10:36.335 --> 00:10:40.965
I should return to the camp,
wait for word on the virus.

00:10:41.040 --> 00:10:45.841
I'll go with you... in case
you run into any more trouble.

00:10:45.911 --> 00:10:48.141
As you wish.

00:10:49.749 --> 00:10:54.152
I'm sure Korok
will be glad to see me.

00:11:13.239 --> 00:11:15.207
Tuvok...

00:11:16.742 --> 00:11:19.176
Where are you, Tuvok?

00:11:19.245 --> 00:11:20.678
Commander?

00:11:20.746 --> 00:11:23.180
Stardate 38774...

00:11:23.249 --> 00:11:25.183
Vulcanis Lunar Colony.

00:11:25.251 --> 00:11:27.845
The time and place of my birth.

00:11:27.920 --> 00:11:32.380
Recalling the details of my life
helps me remain focused.

00:11:32.458 --> 00:11:35.689
Captain, if I succumb
to the collective,

00:11:35.761 --> 00:11:37.524
I'll pose a security risk.

00:11:37.596 --> 00:11:40.156
You must be prepared
to deactivate me.

00:11:40.232 --> 00:11:42.962
Without the Doctor's help,
that could kill you.

00:11:43.102 --> 00:11:44.364
Stay focused.

00:11:44.437 --> 00:11:45.699
Stay Tuvok.

00:11:45.771 --> 00:11:47.329
That's an order.

00:11:49.408 --> 00:11:53.242
Captain, I've bypassed
the access codes.

00:12:08.561 --> 00:12:10.552
Welcome to the central plexus.

00:12:29.749 --> 00:12:31.182
Tuvok...

00:12:31.250 --> 00:12:33.218
Where are you, Tuvok?

00:12:49.435 --> 00:12:51.198
Busy?

00:12:51.270 --> 00:12:53.204
What's on your mind?

00:12:53.272 --> 00:12:55.206
The away team.

00:12:55.274 --> 00:12:56.969
The plan was
to give them two hours.

00:12:57.042 --> 00:12:58.475
It's been 21/2.

00:12:58.544 --> 00:13:00.341
Doctor's keeping
an eye on them.

00:13:00.412 --> 00:13:02.676
We'll give it
a little more time.

00:13:02.748 --> 00:13:06.479
Unfortunately, not everything
goes according to plan.

00:13:06.552 --> 00:13:11.489
You know, it occurs to me that,
with you in command,

00:13:11.557 --> 00:13:13.149
and Tuvok off the ship,

00:13:13.225 --> 00:13:15.693
that makes me
Acting First Officer,

00:13:15.761 --> 00:13:17.319
technically speaking.

00:13:17.396 --> 00:13:18.886
What's your point?

00:13:18.964 --> 00:13:21.057
Well, it's my duty
to give you an opinion,

00:13:21.133 --> 00:13:22.725
and in my opinion,

00:13:22.802 --> 00:13:25.600
I think we should pull them
out now before it's too late.

00:13:25.671 --> 00:13:28.606
I appreciate your diligence...

00:13:28.674 --> 00:13:31.541
but I've made my decision.

00:13:31.610 --> 00:13:33.043
We wait.

00:13:35.414 --> 00:13:36.574
How long?

00:13:36.649 --> 00:13:38.139
A day? A week?

00:13:38.217 --> 00:13:40.208
As long as it takes
to complete the mission.

00:13:40.286 --> 00:13:42.652
This mission
isn't worth their lives.

00:13:42.721 --> 00:13:44.052
You've made your point.

00:13:44.123 --> 00:13:46.216
Apparently not.

00:13:47.626 --> 00:13:48.820
Lieutenant.

00:13:53.432 --> 00:13:55.696
A First Officer could get
in a lot of trouble

00:13:55.768 --> 00:13:57.599
for talking
to his Captain that way.

00:13:57.670 --> 00:13:59.934
Well, I've learned
from the best.

00:14:03.209 --> 00:14:08.272
I appreciate your concerns, Tom,
but I need your support on this.

00:14:09.715 --> 00:14:11.182
Aye, sir.

00:14:42.748 --> 00:14:44.545
Download the virus.

00:15:02.768 --> 00:15:06.135
Tuvok...

00:15:06.205 --> 00:15:10.073
My daughter's name is Asil.

00:15:10.142 --> 00:15:12.235
She was born...

00:15:12.311 --> 00:15:14.643
In the city of T'Paal.

00:15:14.713 --> 00:15:16.840
We share your memories.

00:15:16.916 --> 00:15:19.043
You are part of us now.

00:15:19.118 --> 00:15:21.416
Don't resist.

00:15:22.821 --> 00:15:24.413
There's a problem
with Commander Tuvok.

00:15:24.490 --> 00:15:27.948
His synaptic pathways
are destabilizing.

00:15:29.728 --> 00:15:31.889
If I decide to move in closer,

00:15:31.964 --> 00:15:34.933
I assume my First Officer
would concur.

00:15:35.067 --> 00:15:37.035
You assume correctly.

00:15:49.748 --> 00:15:51.682
We have to get out
of this chamber

00:15:51.750 --> 00:15:53.217
and contact Voyager.

00:15:58.457 --> 00:16:00.288
You're Commander Tuvok,

00:16:00.359 --> 00:16:03.795
Tactical Officer
of the Starship Voyager.

00:16:03.862 --> 00:16:05.124
I'm your Captain.

00:16:05.197 --> 00:16:06.664
Step aside.
That's an order.

00:16:06.732 --> 00:16:08.256
She's irrelevant.

00:16:10.202 --> 00:16:14.502
Captain, you must deactivate me.

00:16:18.677 --> 00:16:22.511
My designation
is Three of Twelve.

00:16:22.581 --> 00:16:24.742
Where are you, Tuvok?

00:16:28.253 --> 00:16:31.120
The central plexus.

00:16:39.498 --> 00:16:40.760
Range: 40,000 kilometers.

00:16:40.833 --> 00:16:41.822
Harry?

00:16:41.900 --> 00:16:44.300
Too much shielding
around the central plexus.

00:16:44.370 --> 00:16:45.302
I can't get a lock.

00:16:45.371 --> 00:16:46.633
Stay on it.

00:16:46.705 --> 00:16:48.002
Closer.

00:16:52.678 --> 00:16:53.770
This way.

00:17:18.904 --> 00:17:21.236
Back so soon?

00:17:25.310 --> 00:17:27.141
Target their shield generators.

00:17:27.212 --> 00:17:28.907
Stand by phasers.

00:17:28.981 --> 00:17:30.414
Commander?

00:17:30.482 --> 00:17:32.746
Shields to full.

00:17:32.818 --> 00:17:34.285
Brace for impact.

00:17:34.353 --> 00:17:36.378
Someone's accessing
our tactical controls.

00:17:36.455 --> 00:17:38.719
Our shields are down.

00:17:38.791 --> 00:17:39.985
Evasive maneuvers.

00:17:44.997 --> 00:17:47.022
Sensors are off-line!
I've lost the away team!

00:17:47.099 --> 00:17:51.035
Hull breaches...
Decks 5, 6, 7!

00:17:51.103 --> 00:17:53.230
Reverse course.

00:17:53.305 --> 00:17:55.239
We can't just leave them.

00:17:55.307 --> 00:17:57.241
The Borg have our access codes.

00:17:57.309 --> 00:17:58.606
Get us out of here.

00:18:01.647 --> 00:18:03.615
Thank you, Tuvok.

00:18:12.024 --> 00:18:13.651
I'm losing voices.

00:18:15.694 --> 00:18:19.494
Five in Spatial Grid 96.

00:18:20.699 --> 00:18:23.827
Twelve in Grid 182.

00:18:25.037 --> 00:18:26.504
Hundreds now...

00:18:27.706 --> 00:18:29.173
thousands.

00:18:46.058 --> 00:18:49.152
I can't hear you.

00:18:49.228 --> 00:18:51.196
Why can't I hear you?

00:18:57.002 --> 00:18:58.936
You've disconnected
from the hive mind.

00:18:59.004 --> 00:19:00.335
Explain.

00:19:02.508 --> 00:19:04.305
Comply.

00:19:04.376 --> 00:19:05.343
No!

00:19:08.714 --> 00:19:10.807
I'm not alone.

00:19:10.883 --> 00:19:13.351
You can't stop us all!

00:19:44.650 --> 00:19:47.210
I altered the transmission

00:19:47.286 --> 00:19:49.777
to restore your
original appearance.

00:19:49.855 --> 00:19:52.255
I know how vain humans can be.

00:19:52.324 --> 00:19:53.450
Why am I here?

00:19:53.525 --> 00:19:56.221
You've caused a great
deal of suffering.

00:19:56.295 --> 00:19:58.559
I wanted you
to see for yourself.

00:19:58.630 --> 00:20:01.929
You are the cause
of his death, Captain.

00:20:02.034 --> 00:20:04.662
You disconnected him
from the hive mind.

00:20:04.736 --> 00:20:07.296
You didn't have to kill him.

00:20:07.372 --> 00:20:09.932
He was confused, irrational.

00:20:10.042 --> 00:20:11.805
I had no choice.

00:20:11.877 --> 00:20:15.574
Many more will die,
unless you tell me

00:20:15.647 --> 00:20:17.877
how to counteract the virus.

00:20:17.950 --> 00:20:21.681
Sorry, we didn't think
to develop an antidote.

00:20:21.753 --> 00:20:24.381
I'll assimilate Voyager, then.

00:20:24.456 --> 00:20:26.947
Your Doctor created
the pathogen.

00:20:27.092 --> 00:20:29.185
He can find a cure.

00:20:29.261 --> 00:20:31.957
My First Officer has orders
to delete the Doctor's program

00:20:32.030 --> 00:20:34.624
if you go anywhere near Voyager.

00:20:34.700 --> 00:20:36.565
The resistance is
already underway.

00:20:36.635 --> 00:20:37.795
It won't be long before

00:20:37.869 --> 00:20:40.167
thousands of drones begin
to fight back.

00:20:40.239 --> 00:20:41.763
They will fail.

00:20:41.840 --> 00:20:44.240
Maybe...

00:20:44.309 --> 00:20:45.833
probably...

00:20:45.911 --> 00:20:48.971
but a lot of damage will be done
before they do.

00:20:49.114 --> 00:20:52.982
Yes, a lot of damage.

00:20:53.085 --> 00:20:58.352
Spatial Grid 94, Cube 630.

00:20:58.423 --> 00:21:00.550
Complement: 64,000 drones,

00:21:00.626 --> 00:21:04.187
but I can no longer hear
three of them.

00:21:04.263 --> 00:21:07.721
No doubt they've joined
your resistance.

00:21:07.799 --> 00:21:11.394
Are they trying
to sabotage the vessel

00:21:11.470 --> 00:21:14.337
and liberate others?

00:21:14.406 --> 00:21:19.173
I don't know, because I
can no longer hear them.

00:21:20.879 --> 00:21:23.006
Initiate self-destruct.

00:21:24.883 --> 00:21:26.976
An effective solution,
don't you agree?

00:21:28.754 --> 00:21:33.191
Spatial Grid 091, Sphere 878.

00:21:33.258 --> 00:21:35.852
Complement: 11,000 drones.

00:21:35.927 --> 00:21:38.953
Only one is silent,

00:21:39.064 --> 00:21:42.761
but I have no choice.

00:21:42.834 --> 00:21:44.699
I must silence all of them.

00:21:51.109 --> 00:21:53.737
I know how this must upset you,
Captain.

00:21:53.812 --> 00:21:58.078
As a Starfleet officer,
you value all life,

00:21:58.150 --> 00:22:00.744
even drones.

00:22:00.819 --> 00:22:04.585
How many more are you willing
to sacrifice?

00:22:04.656 --> 00:22:06.283
Thousands?

00:22:06.358 --> 00:22:10.089
Millions?

00:22:10.162 --> 00:22:14.929
You can put an end to this.

00:22:15.067 --> 00:22:19.436
I want you to go
on a diplomatic mission.

00:22:19.504 --> 00:22:22.473
It's one of your primary
functions, isn't it?

00:22:22.541 --> 00:22:23.940
Negotiations?

00:22:24.042 --> 00:22:24.940
Go on.

00:22:25.043 --> 00:22:27.511
Tell them to rejoin

00:22:27.579 --> 00:22:30.412
the collective, and I'll
stop the destruction.

00:22:30.482 --> 00:22:32.916
They will never agree to that.

00:22:32.984 --> 00:22:35.578
They're individuals now.

00:22:35.654 --> 00:22:37.383
They have a choice.

00:22:39.024 --> 00:22:42.084
What are you afraid of, Captain?

00:22:42.160 --> 00:22:44.594
That they may cooperate?

00:22:44.663 --> 00:22:48.292
You've been waiting for a chance
to damage the Borg.

00:22:48.367 --> 00:22:49.857
Now you've found one.

00:22:49.935 --> 00:22:52.802
You're only using them.

00:22:52.871 --> 00:22:56.102
If you really wanted
to negotiate,

00:22:56.174 --> 00:22:58.904
you'd visit Unimatrix Zero.

00:22:58.977 --> 00:23:01.309
You found a way to send drones.

00:23:01.380 --> 00:23:03.143
Surely, you could go yourself.

00:23:03.215 --> 00:23:04.682
Or are you afraid

00:23:04.750 --> 00:23:07.241
that a taste of individuality
might make you realize

00:23:07.319 --> 00:23:09.844
it is something
worth fighting for?

00:23:13.458 --> 00:23:14.823
Comply, or you will be

00:23:14.893 --> 00:23:19.455
responsible
for many more deaths.

00:23:19.531 --> 00:23:22.898
You'll have to destroy
the entire collective

00:23:22.968 --> 00:23:24.299
to find them all.

00:23:39.351 --> 00:23:41.819
Several drones have reported
that they retained

00:23:41.887 --> 00:23:45.220
their memories of Unimatrix Zero
after their regeneration ended.

00:23:45.290 --> 00:23:46.587
The virus has been deployed.

00:23:46.658 --> 00:23:48.649
Good. We're going to need
all the help we can get.

00:23:48.727 --> 00:23:50.558
The away team's still trapped
on that cube.

00:23:50.629 --> 00:23:51.891
And as you may have noticed,

00:23:51.963 --> 00:23:53.658
we're in no shape
to mount a rescue.

00:23:53.732 --> 00:23:55.290
Can you get back in,

00:23:55.367 --> 00:23:58.131
find out if they have anyone
else aboard this cube?

00:23:58.203 --> 00:23:59.538
If they do, tell them to hurry.

00:23:59.538 --> 00:23:59.970
If they do, tell them to hurry.

00:24:00.105 --> 00:24:02.039
They're the only allies
we've got.

00:24:02.107 --> 00:24:04.803
I'd like to make
a few adjustments to your alcove

00:24:04.876 --> 00:24:05.900
before you return.

00:24:09.681 --> 00:24:10.909
When this crisis ends,

00:24:11.016 --> 00:24:13.610
I'll come up with a more
permanent solution,

00:24:13.685 --> 00:24:16.449
so you can spend more
time in Unimatrix Zero.

00:24:16.521 --> 00:24:19.081
You're in a unique position.

00:24:19.157 --> 00:24:22.786
Not many of us get
to lead a double life.

00:24:22.861 --> 00:24:24.055
When this crisis ends,

00:24:24.129 --> 00:24:26.723
I intend to sever my link
to Unimatrix Zero.

00:24:26.798 --> 00:24:29.232
May I ask why?

00:24:29.301 --> 00:24:33.499
I'm having difficulties
with one of the people there.

00:24:33.572 --> 00:24:36.735
Mr. Axum?

00:24:36.808 --> 00:24:39.106
Whenever you mention his name,

00:24:39.177 --> 00:24:41.236
your pupils dilate
by nearly a millimeter,

00:24:41.313 --> 00:24:42.302
blood flow increases

00:24:42.380 --> 00:24:43.938
to your facial capillaries.

00:24:44.082 --> 00:24:46.983
Both are consistent
with an emotional response.

00:24:49.120 --> 00:24:52.783
Axum and I apparently had
a relationship.

00:24:52.858 --> 00:24:55.088
Oh. Romantic?

00:24:57.362 --> 00:24:59.421
There go those pupils again.

00:25:01.132 --> 00:25:04.192
Your diagnosis is accurate.

00:25:06.137 --> 00:25:07.570
Well...

00:25:10.709 --> 00:25:13.109
how ironic.

00:25:13.178 --> 00:25:16.238
All this time,
we've been trying to develop

00:25:16.314 --> 00:25:20.580
that aspect of your humanity,
and it's been there all along.

00:25:20.652 --> 00:25:22.483
Not anymore.

00:25:22.554 --> 00:25:24.385
My readings say otherwise.

00:25:28.360 --> 00:25:29.759
You're very particular

00:25:29.828 --> 00:25:32.820
about who you choose to
spend time with, Seven.

00:25:32.898 --> 00:25:36.766
No doubt that's why
you and I have become friends.

00:25:36.835 --> 00:25:39.929
If you were involved
with Axum once,

00:25:40.005 --> 00:25:43.133
doesn't that suggest
he's a worthwhile individual?

00:25:44.209 --> 00:25:49.340
He does possess
commendable qualities.

00:25:49.414 --> 00:25:53.612
Coming from you,
that's high praise.

00:25:53.685 --> 00:25:58.281
There's nothing wrong
with feeling ambivalent, Seven.

00:25:58.356 --> 00:26:01.291
After all, you're in
the middle of a civil war,

00:26:01.359 --> 00:26:04.886
but eventually, you may want

00:26:04.963 --> 00:26:09.764
to give this romance
a second chance.

00:26:09.834 --> 00:26:11.267
Who knows?

00:26:11.336 --> 00:26:14.203
You may even get to meet
him in person someday.

00:26:21.813 --> 00:26:24.179
I'll say this for your Mr. Axum.

00:26:24.249 --> 00:26:26.444
He's a very lucky man.

00:26:38.229 --> 00:26:41.824
The collective has found
a new way to attack us.

00:26:41.900 --> 00:26:45.131
11 ships have self-destructed
in the last three hours.

00:26:45.203 --> 00:26:47.296
We need to coordinate
a battle plan,

00:26:47.372 --> 00:26:50.102
a way to strike at the heart
of the collective.

00:26:50.175 --> 00:26:52.575
Our target should be
the primary unicomplex.

00:26:52.644 --> 00:26:55.704
If we can disrupt the queen's
control of the hive mind,

00:26:55.780 --> 00:26:57.077
it'll give us a chance
to organize,

00:26:57.148 --> 00:26:58.115
build up a fighting force.

00:26:59.284 --> 00:27:01.252
There is one more objective...

00:27:01.319 --> 00:27:03.116
the Voyager away team.

00:27:03.188 --> 00:27:04.655
They fought like warriors.

00:27:04.723 --> 00:27:07.021
Their sacrifice will
not be forgotten.

00:27:07.092 --> 00:27:09.026
We can still rescue them.

00:27:09.094 --> 00:27:10.425
She's right.

00:27:10.495 --> 00:27:12.258
They risked their lives for us.

00:27:13.531 --> 00:27:14.589
Now it's our turn.

00:27:14.666 --> 00:27:16.258
There's no time!

00:27:16.334 --> 00:27:18.894
It's a matter of honor, Korok.

00:27:18.970 --> 00:27:22.565
I thought you of all people
would understand that.

00:27:24.175 --> 00:27:28.475
I'll see if any of our people
are on a vessel near theirs.

00:27:36.855 --> 00:27:38.914
Thank you.

00:27:38.990 --> 00:27:40.719
It's the least we can do.

00:27:44.796 --> 00:27:47.356
What's wrong?

00:27:47.432 --> 00:27:49.423
It turns out I'm on a scout ship

00:27:49.501 --> 00:27:51.935
patrolling the border
of fluidic space...

00:27:52.037 --> 00:27:55.097
on the other side of the galaxy.

00:28:01.946 --> 00:28:07.009
I... was hoping we'd be able
to meet one day,

00:28:07.085 --> 00:28:08.712
in the real world.

00:28:10.689 --> 00:28:12.384
Me, too.

00:28:14.793 --> 00:28:18.422
There are things
I can do where I am.

00:28:18.496 --> 00:28:22.660
I'll try to contact
Species 8472,

00:28:22.734 --> 00:28:25.726
see if I can persuade
them to join the fight.

00:28:25.804 --> 00:28:27.738
Given their history
with the Borg,

00:28:27.806 --> 00:28:30.138
I'm sure they'll be eager.

00:28:35.780 --> 00:28:39.272
I guess this rules out
Vorothon Gorge.

00:28:39.350 --> 00:28:42.615
"Gorge"?

00:28:42.687 --> 00:28:44.154
It was at the top of our list

00:28:44.222 --> 00:28:45.917
of things to see
in the real world

00:28:46.057 --> 00:28:48.252
if we were ever freed
from the collective.

00:28:48.326 --> 00:28:50.521
Don't you remember?

00:28:50.595 --> 00:28:53.393
We could add fluidic
space to our list.

00:28:58.403 --> 00:29:00.837
We still have Unimatrix Zero.

00:29:05.577 --> 00:29:07.477
It was sufficient before.

00:29:09.547 --> 00:29:11.777
And now?

00:29:41.379 --> 00:29:42.505
Where are you?

00:29:42.580 --> 00:29:43.706
Over here.

00:30:02.000 --> 00:30:04.798
Don't be frightened.

00:30:04.869 --> 00:30:07.133
Stand up, let me look at you.

00:30:07.205 --> 00:30:09.173
Comply.

00:30:11.543 --> 00:30:13.670
You're one
of the machine people.

00:30:13.745 --> 00:30:15.372
You're trying to hurt us.

00:30:17.549 --> 00:30:20.814
That's the last thing
I want to do.

00:30:20.885 --> 00:30:23.319
I'm here to help you...

00:30:23.388 --> 00:30:25.049
all of you.

00:30:25.123 --> 00:30:27.250
They said you wanted to

00:30:27.325 --> 00:30:29.486
assim... assimi...

00:30:29.561 --> 00:30:31.893
Assimilate you.

00:30:31.963 --> 00:30:36.696
Yes, but that's nothing
to be afraid of.

00:30:36.768 --> 00:30:39.100
You like having friends,
don't you?

00:30:39.170 --> 00:30:42.765
Assimilation
turns us all into friends.

00:30:42.841 --> 00:30:45.309
In fact, it brings us
so close together,

00:30:45.376 --> 00:30:47.503
we can hear
each other's thoughts.

00:30:47.579 --> 00:30:49.638
Is that fun?

00:30:51.249 --> 00:30:52.773
Yes.

00:30:52.851 --> 00:30:54.478
It's fun.

00:30:59.524 --> 00:31:03.460
I was just about your age
when I was assimilated.

00:31:03.528 --> 00:31:05.325
I was worried then, too.

00:31:07.365 --> 00:31:10.129
But when I began
to hear the others,

00:31:10.201 --> 00:31:12.135
hear their thoughts,

00:31:12.203 --> 00:31:14.501
I wasn't afraid anymore.

00:31:14.572 --> 00:31:16.802
Don't you miss your parents?

00:31:16.875 --> 00:31:18.069
They're here

00:31:18.142 --> 00:31:21.839
with me... part of us.

00:31:23.882 --> 00:31:28.615
I can hear them right now.

00:31:28.686 --> 00:31:30.950
Would you like to be
with your parents?

00:31:31.055 --> 00:31:32.955
They miss you.

00:31:33.091 --> 00:31:34.581
They want to see you.

00:31:34.659 --> 00:31:36.058
Can I talk to them?

00:31:36.127 --> 00:31:38.095
Soon.

00:31:39.330 --> 00:31:42.697
But first...
I'd like to see more of this.

00:31:42.767 --> 00:31:44.064
There's a place

00:31:44.135 --> 00:31:46.194
where you can see
the whole forest.

00:31:48.239 --> 00:31:49.536
Show me.

00:31:58.349 --> 00:32:01.147
It's pretty, isn't it?

00:32:12.196 --> 00:32:14.926
I took your advice, Captain.

00:32:15.033 --> 00:32:17.263
I paid a visit
to Unimatrix Zero.

00:32:17.335 --> 00:32:20.133
It's far more primitive
than I expected.

00:32:20.204 --> 00:32:22.138
I don't understand how anyone

00:32:22.206 --> 00:32:25.733
could prefer a crude environment
to Borg perfection.

00:32:25.810 --> 00:32:28.836
Spend a little more time there.

00:32:28.913 --> 00:32:30.744
You might find out.

00:32:30.815 --> 00:32:32.077
I've seen enough.

00:32:32.150 --> 00:32:33.481
It's an illusion.

00:32:33.551 --> 00:32:36.349
Even so, the people
who go there are real,

00:32:36.421 --> 00:32:38.616
and they won't give it up
without a fight.

00:32:38.690 --> 00:32:40.157
They'll fail.

00:32:40.224 --> 00:32:42.590
I thought you'd like

00:32:42.660 --> 00:32:45.060
to see our latest
accomplishment.

00:32:46.564 --> 00:32:48.122
Recognize it?

00:32:50.902 --> 00:32:52.301
No.

00:32:52.370 --> 00:32:54.429
I think you do.

00:32:54.505 --> 00:32:56.905
It's your nanovirus,
with a few modifications.

00:32:56.975 --> 00:33:01.742
We've reprogrammed it
to target your mutated drones.

00:33:01.813 --> 00:33:05.078
Once it's released,
it will erode

00:33:05.149 --> 00:33:07.447
their autonomic functions.

00:33:07.518 --> 00:33:10.112
They will die within minutes.

00:33:10.188 --> 00:33:12.179
You have no way to deliver it.

00:33:12.256 --> 00:33:15.783
Those drones have been separated
from the hive mind.

00:33:15.860 --> 00:33:19.626
They aren't linked
to the central plexus anymore.

00:33:19.697 --> 00:33:24.134
No, but there's another way
I can reach them.

00:33:24.202 --> 00:33:25.829
I'm prepared to go back

00:33:25.903 --> 00:33:28.804
to Unimatrix Zero
and release it myself,

00:33:28.873 --> 00:33:32.206
but I'm willing to reconsider.

00:33:32.276 --> 00:33:34.801
It all depends on you.

00:33:34.879 --> 00:33:36.141
Me?

00:33:36.214 --> 00:33:37.943
If they rejoin the collective,

00:33:38.049 --> 00:33:39.812
I'll spare their lives.

00:33:39.884 --> 00:33:41.943
They listen to you.

00:33:42.086 --> 00:33:45.351
Tell them it's time
to come home.

00:33:45.423 --> 00:33:49.154
You were responsible
for many deaths.

00:33:49.227 --> 00:33:52.128
Now you can save thousands.

00:33:52.196 --> 00:33:54.164
Decide.

00:33:58.903 --> 00:34:00.598
Let's try this again.

00:34:00.671 --> 00:34:03.105
Ensign?

00:34:03.174 --> 00:34:05.699
The warp core is on line,
navigational array,

00:34:05.777 --> 00:34:07.244
shields at 20 percent.

00:34:07.311 --> 00:34:10.109
We've got sensors,
short-range only.

00:34:10.181 --> 00:34:12.115
It's a start.

00:34:12.183 --> 00:34:14.242
Try to get a fix
on the away team.

00:34:16.521 --> 00:34:17.749
Now what?

00:34:17.822 --> 00:34:19.722
Someone's tapping
into our holographic systems.

00:34:19.791 --> 00:34:20.849
Source?

00:34:20.925 --> 00:34:22.654
It's a Borg signal.

00:34:22.727 --> 00:34:24.251
Doctor to the Bridge.

00:34:24.328 --> 00:34:25.659
Go ahead.

00:34:25.730 --> 00:34:28.198
Someone's here to see you
and Seven, Commander.

00:34:28.266 --> 00:34:30.359
You'd better
come down here right away.

00:34:41.913 --> 00:34:43.380
Kathryn?

00:34:45.216 --> 00:34:47.514
The Borg have
established this link,

00:34:47.585 --> 00:34:49.780
so I could propose
a compromise.

00:34:49.854 --> 00:34:52.049
We're listening.

00:34:52.123 --> 00:34:55.251
They've developed a nanovirus
that can kill every Borg

00:34:55.326 --> 00:34:56.725
with the mutation.

00:34:56.794 --> 00:35:00.423
They're prepared to release it
inside Unimatrix Zero,

00:35:00.498 --> 00:35:03.433
unless all the drones there
return to the collective

00:35:03.501 --> 00:35:05.765
for reassimilation immediately.

00:35:05.837 --> 00:35:08.203
That's not compromise...
that's surrender.

00:35:08.272 --> 00:35:12.106
I won't be responsible
for any more deaths.

00:35:12.176 --> 00:35:14.542
At least they'll survive
as drones.

00:35:14.612 --> 00:35:21.245
Tell them Unimatrix Zero
can no longer exist.

00:35:21.319 --> 00:35:23.583
That's an order.

00:35:24.655 --> 00:35:28.955
Have I made myself clear,
Commander?

00:35:30.528 --> 00:35:33.395
Yes, Captain.

00:35:37.368 --> 00:35:39.495
We did our best.

00:35:39.570 --> 00:35:41.902
It's not over yet, Doctor.

00:35:41.973 --> 00:35:43.463
Can you disrupt

00:35:43.541 --> 00:35:45.736
the interlink frequency
for Unimatrix Zero?

00:35:45.810 --> 00:35:47.300
Commander...

00:35:47.378 --> 00:35:49.243
the Captain gave us
a direct order.

00:35:49.313 --> 00:35:51.281
Yes, she did,
but not the one you think.

00:35:51.349 --> 00:35:52.373
Seven?

00:35:52.450 --> 00:35:55.476
I believe I can, but why?

00:35:55.553 --> 00:35:56.884
Didn't you hear?

00:35:56.954 --> 00:35:59.946
Unimatrix Zero
can no longer exist.

00:36:02.460 --> 00:36:05.725
Chakotay to the Bridge.
Report.

00:36:05.796 --> 00:36:09.562
A transwarp conduit
just opened off our port bow.

00:36:09.634 --> 00:36:11.795
Lieutenant.

00:36:11.869 --> 00:36:14.804
They're on an intercept course.

00:36:14.872 --> 00:36:16.430
Evasive maneuvers.

00:36:16.507 --> 00:36:17.769
Battle stations.

00:36:17.842 --> 00:36:19.104
They're hailing us.

00:36:19.177 --> 00:36:20.906
Open a channel.

00:36:20.978 --> 00:36:22.912
Starship Voyager.

00:36:23.014 --> 00:36:24.777
I am General Korok.

00:36:24.849 --> 00:36:28.444
This vessel is now
under my command.

00:36:28.519 --> 00:36:30.680
We've come to join you
in battle.

00:36:39.397 --> 00:36:42.958
Your crewmates are coming
to retrieve you.

00:36:44.602 --> 00:36:46.695
You were wise to comply.

00:36:48.739 --> 00:36:50.331
Chakotay to Seven of Nine.

00:36:50.408 --> 00:36:51.773
We're almost in range.

00:36:51.842 --> 00:36:53.275
Stand by.

00:36:55.246 --> 00:36:56.907
I've isolated the frequency.

00:36:58.783 --> 00:37:00.910
Get Korok.

00:37:05.022 --> 00:37:06.785
Our emitters are fully charged.

00:37:06.857 --> 00:37:09.519
You should be receiving
the interlink frequency.

00:37:09.594 --> 00:37:11.494
We have it.

00:37:11.562 --> 00:37:13.189
Wait for my signal.

00:37:13.264 --> 00:37:15.528
We have to end our
regeneration cycles.

00:37:15.600 --> 00:37:17.261
We can't be here
when it happens.

00:37:17.335 --> 00:37:18.768
Will there be anything left?

00:37:18.836 --> 00:37:23.102
I know we're being asked
to make a sacrifice,

00:37:23.174 --> 00:37:25.369
but it's the only way.

00:37:26.444 --> 00:37:27.672
We're in range.

00:37:27.745 --> 00:37:29.007
Full power to the shields.

00:37:29.080 --> 00:37:31.048
All weapons on line.

00:37:31.115 --> 00:37:32.844
Voyager to Korok.

00:37:32.917 --> 00:37:34.578
It's time.

00:37:51.802 --> 00:37:54.066
You must go.

00:38:01.846 --> 00:38:04.872
Bridge, it's working.

00:38:04.982 --> 00:38:07.883
Unimatrix Zero is shutting down.

00:38:08.019 --> 00:38:09.646
Acknowledged.

00:38:09.720 --> 00:38:11.620
Voyager to Korok.

00:38:11.689 --> 00:38:13.213
Now.

00:38:15.293 --> 00:38:16.760
What are they doing?

00:38:16.827 --> 00:38:19.318
You wanted to destroy
Unimatrix Zero.

00:38:19.397 --> 00:38:24.061
We're just lending you a hand.

00:38:24.135 --> 00:38:25.432
Get me the virus.

00:38:25.503 --> 00:38:28.063
You're too late.
There's no one left to infect.

00:38:28.139 --> 00:38:29.800
Is this your compromise?

00:38:29.874 --> 00:38:33.366
I don't compromise with Borg.

00:38:45.389 --> 00:38:47.653
Match their shield modulations
and fire!

00:39:28.666 --> 00:39:30.258
I'm picking up the away team!

00:39:30.334 --> 00:39:32.632
I'm isolating
their bio-signatures.

00:39:32.703 --> 00:39:33.829
Get a lock.

00:39:33.904 --> 00:39:38.136
I still can't penetrate
their inner shields.

00:39:38.209 --> 00:39:39.676
Voyager to Korok.

00:39:39.744 --> 00:39:41.405
Status?

00:39:41.479 --> 00:39:44.812
Patience, Commander.

00:39:44.882 --> 00:39:47.544
They're trying to remodulate
their secondary shield grid.

00:39:47.618 --> 00:39:49.882
I'm attempting to compensate.

00:40:10.574 --> 00:40:11.871
You shouldn't be here.

00:40:11.942 --> 00:40:13.466
Neither should you.

00:40:15.379 --> 00:40:17.074
I've wasted our time together.

00:40:17.148 --> 00:40:18.137
No, you didn't.

00:40:18.215 --> 00:40:21.207
You gave us a chance
to fall in love again.

00:40:21.285 --> 00:40:23.913
We've lost our only way
to be together.

00:40:23.988 --> 00:40:24.955
No. I'll find you.

00:40:25.089 --> 00:40:26.954
Axum?

00:40:27.057 --> 00:40:29.218
I'll find you.

00:40:46.744 --> 00:40:50.544
Shields in Subgrid 42
are destabilizing.

00:40:50.614 --> 00:40:51.945
Target that section.

00:41:04.228 --> 00:41:07.891
Initiate self-destruct.

00:41:14.238 --> 00:41:15.728
Their shields are down.

00:41:15.806 --> 00:41:16.932
Energize.

00:41:30.454 --> 00:41:35.892
Chief Medical Officer's Log,
Stardate 54014.4.

00:41:35.960 --> 00:41:37.552
It's been 48 hours

00:41:37.628 --> 00:41:39.823
since the away team
returned to Voyager.

00:41:39.897 --> 00:41:41.660
Thanks
to the neural suppressant,

00:41:41.732 --> 00:41:44.394
I've been able to extract
most of their Borg technology.

00:41:44.468 --> 00:41:47.801
The Captain and B'Elanna
are on the mend,

00:41:47.872 --> 00:41:51.569
but Tuvok will need
a little more time to recover.

00:41:56.680 --> 00:41:58.910
General Korok has
finished his repairs.

00:41:58.983 --> 00:42:01.679
He's already been contacted
by another Borg

00:42:01.752 --> 00:42:03.014
vessel in the region.

00:42:03.087 --> 00:42:05.146
It's also under the control
of former drones.

00:42:06.857 --> 00:42:08.848
The Doctor removed
my spinal clamps,

00:42:08.926 --> 00:42:10.518
but it'll be a while

00:42:10.594 --> 00:42:12.585
before I'm playing
hoverball again.

00:42:12.663 --> 00:42:16.394
If I ever imply it's been easy
on you these last few years,

00:42:16.467 --> 00:42:17.934
remind me about today.

00:42:18.035 --> 00:42:19.525
Noted.

00:42:19.603 --> 00:42:23.733
Well, Unimatrix Zero
may be gone,

00:42:23.807 --> 00:42:27.208
but it looks like the resistance
is alive and kicking.

00:42:27.278 --> 00:42:30.805
With any luck, the collective
may never be the same.

00:42:30.881 --> 00:42:33.145
Korok said he would try
to maintain contact,

00:42:33.217 --> 00:42:35.447
keep us informed.

00:42:35.519 --> 00:42:38.784
Have you heard from your friend?

00:42:38.856 --> 00:42:43.589
No... but I don't expect to.

00:42:43.661 --> 00:42:47.188
Axum's vessel is in a remote
sector of the Beta Quadrant.

00:42:51.268 --> 00:42:54.294
If I ever imply

00:42:54.371 --> 00:42:57.431
that he was nothing
more than a friend,

00:42:57.508 --> 00:43:01.501
remind me about today.
